
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Reset Your Password</title>
</head>

<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4;">

  <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 30px auto; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 10px;">

    <h2 style="color: #2563eb; text-align: center;">
      Developer Assessment Platform
    </h2>

    <h3>Hello, <%= name %>!</h3>

    <p>
      We received a request to reset the password for your account.
    </p>

    <p>
      Click the button below to reset your password.
    </p>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
      Reset Password OTP :
       <h1> <%= otp  %> </h1> 
    </div>

    <p>
      If you did not request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email.
      Your password will remain unchanged.
    </p>

    <p style="color: #666666; font-size: 13px;">
      For your security, this password reset link should expire after a short time
      and must be used only once.
    </p>

    <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
      Best regards,<br />
      <strong>Developer Assessment Platform Team</strong>
    </p>

    <p style="color: #666666; font-size: 12px; text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
      &copy; Developer Assessment Platform. All rights reserved.
    </p>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
